  "id": "EUVD-2026-120161",
  "enisaUuid": "8b7b26c2-d37e-3f95-9af9-148b80d2f24a",
  "description": "A flaw was found in ansible-core's ansible.builtin.git module. The module\ninvokes git (ls-remote, clone, fetch) with the repository URL as a positional\nargument and without a \"--\" separator, so a repository URL that begins with a\ndash is interpreted by git as a command-line option. A caller that passes an\nattacker-controlled repository URL to the module can trigger argument\ninjection (for example --upload-pack/--exec), resulting in arbitrary command\nexecution on the host running the module.",
